WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:04,630
From a good girl group

2
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:05,670
Then dance a bit

3
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:13,090
If you could have cooperated like this in the original camp, there wouldn't have been so much trouble.

4
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:14,650
That's why we don't want to stay there

5
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:21,120
Who loses the next round?

6
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,640
I'll do a job for the Ying family tomorrow

7
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:23,640
You think beautifully

8
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:26,640
Don't worry about the work of ordinary cars.

9
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:29,900
If you make trouble again, go back here and play.

10
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:35,340
But don’t bring over Yingdi’s set of tofu. Who moved to the countryside? I’ll take a break. I’ll have no food next time. I’ll know.

11
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,540
In fact, this is much more comfortable than Yingdi.

12
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:40,060
At least no one took the fire

13
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,420
A cookie threatens someone

14
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,300
What I fear most now is not work

15
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,020
I don’t know if there will be food after I finish it.

16
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:48,300
So my rule has never changed. Negotiate the price before doing the work.

17
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,300
Complete settlement
